# 2.1 Branching with tree, fork, clone
# Beats: run approach A, open the session tree, then fork the session so the
# same prompt grows a second branch in a new file.
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Type "atomic"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Type "Approach A: add input validation to greet() using a thrown Error for empty names."
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 42s
Type "/tree"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 6s
Down
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 3s
Type "/fork"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 8s
